ve to  come all the way in for a meeting if  they want i don't know  a 3d render change some colors changed  they can instantly have  this information to them once it's  completed and finally  signing documentation and keeping a good  record of all  the signed documents is very important  being able to present your clients  with the ipad and all their sets of  drawings  and they can sign every single page it's  automatically filed  it's automatically stored your job is  saved it means you don't have to go back  after that meeting  scan every single page into the system  file it and then spend another hour  after the meeting  dealing with all the paperwork  everything is already done  because it's already digital lastly  construction  the construction industry is very fast  moving and fast paced  when a job is up and running things  change non-stop variations come in to  your email  24 7. so having the ability to quickly  change a set of documents flick them out  to the builder  and have them understand exactly what  needs to be done without causing any  time delays is very important by having  the ipad at your disposal  you can go to a site meeting for example  markup  what the builder is talking about if  you're working in a good office and a  big firm  you can send that back to somebody in  the office  they can quickly adjust whatever needs  to be adjusted  and potentially even send you a revised  copy  whilst you're still on site again your  information is on the cloud when you're  on site  so whatever information the builder  requires you can easily bring that up  be it pdfs of the drawing specific  details  potentially the 3d model so they can  inspect an area  or even old documentation now can you do  this  on your iphone or your samsung yes 100  you can do it on any smartphone but the  screen  is just too small to actually showcase  and be professional  there is still a very fine line between  being  professional with paper and professional  with your phone out i think having your  ipad out  taking notes on a tablet of any sort is  widely accepted nowadays whereas taking  notes on your phone  and documenting drawing on your phone  still isn't there yet  even though the phones are probably a  much more powerful and versatile tool  and in addition to all the fun facts of  having  your notes on a cloud having the ability  to use a pencil to  sign documents to take all your notes  and everything  be completely documented you have full  access to your emails  with almost a full size keyboard at your  disposal 24 7.  now i hate to break it to you if you  aren't in the profession yet  you're gonna get hundreds of emails  every single day  and it never ends but that's a good  thing it means jobs are coming in and  work is happening  what you're gonna have to do is reply to  those emails continuously and constantly  so having an ipad and being able to type  away  quickly to any email is very very handy  personally i hate typing on glass i do  like the feel of a keyboard  but when you have to it is the best  thing to use  another issue you'll find on site is  most of the jobs  that i do at least are printed on a1 or  a2 paper  if you're on a site and it's a windy or  a rainy day  and you're holding a big sheet of floppy  paper that's just smack it around in the  wind  it's gonna tear and be very difficult to  use  nine times out of ten you're either  gonna have to be inside  or somewhere away from the wind to be  able to utilize and actually read this  paper  whereas with at least one of the newer  ipads it's waterproof  you can use it outside if you want to  get a lifeproof case  even better you can do absolutely  anything  and actually just stand there with a  reasonably sized  tablet they can document and showcase  everything you've drawn  and have everybody convey that  information the only fun fact you need  to remember  is charge your ipad every single night  don't forget to charge this thing  because  unlike paper it does 